### 회원가입 - 정상
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "12345678",
  "nickname": "정글러"
}

### 회원가입 - 잘못된 이메일
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-email",
  "password": "12345678",
  "nickname": "정글러"
}

### 회원가입 - 짧은 비밀번호
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "short@example.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "정글러"
}

### 회원가입 - 중복 이메일
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "12345678",
  "nickname": "다른닉네임"
}


### 로그인 - 정상
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 로그인 - 없는 이메일
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "none@example.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 로그인 - 틀린 비밀번호
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 로그인 - 잘못된 이메일 형식
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-email",
  "password": "12345678"
}